  "body": "* Bright open-plan living & kitchen \r\n* Split-level flexible bedroom layout \r\n* Sunny deck for outdoor relaxing \r\n* Garage + extra off-street parking \r\n* Close to beach, shops & motorway\r\n\r\nSet within Millwater's coveted neighbourhood, this bright 4-bed, 2.5-bath family home sits on a compact 180m² fully fenced section with 166m² practical indoor living space, ideal for modern family life.\r\n\r\nStep through the front entry into a sunlit open-plan living & dining hub, paired with a sleek modern gourmet kitchen finished with dark cabinetry and ample bench storage. Expansive sliding doors extend seamlessly out to a sunny private deck for casual dining and outdoor relaxation.\r\n\r\nClever split-level layout delivers flexible sleeping arrangements: one convenient downstairs bedroom works perfectly as guest room or home office, while three bedrooms upstairs include a private master suite with ensuite bathroom for premium privacy.\r\n\r\nExtra perks include internal single garage plus additional off-street parking spot, alongside easy-care low-upkeep garden. Centrally positioned, it's moments from local schools, Silverdale shopping, Orewa Beach and main motorway access, combining peaceful residential living with superb everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nCall Team Vinson and Amy 022 571 7074 now to book your viewing. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
